hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16743","al-Zubayri narrated to us, he said: Israil narrated to us, from Simak, from Mabad ibn Qays, from Abd Allah ibn Umayr or Umayra, he said: the husband of the daughter of Abu Lahab narrated to me, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) entered upon us when I married the daughter of Abu Lahab and said: Is there any amusement."
